 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "You heard the old command given",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Love your neighbor, hate the foe",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I tell you something new now",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Love your enemies, go and show",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pray for those who persecute",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seek the peace that they refuse",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that you may be sons of the Father",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the heaven above",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He makes his sun rise on the evil",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the good alike",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sends rain on the righteous",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the unrighteous too",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What reward do you have then",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Loving those who love you back",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Even tax collectors do the same",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So your love is not unique",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you greet only your brothers",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What more are you doing now",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Even the Gentiles do the same",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So stand apart in how",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
